footer a{color:inherit}</style></head><body><header class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Pearl Street Pottery</p><h1>Mugs made for slow mornings</h1><p class="sub">Wheel-thrown stoneware, glazed by hand in a home studio off Broadway. Find us at the Pearl every Saturday.</p><a class="btn" href="tel:+12105550123">Call or text</a></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="images/scene-1-w960.svg" srcSet="images/scene-1-w480.svg 480w, images/scene-1-w960.svg 960w, images/scene-1-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 45vw, 100vw" width="1440" height="810" alt="The Pearl Street Pottery booth at the market" loading="eager" decoding="sync" fetchPriority="high"/></div></div></header><main><section class="section" id="products" aria-labelledby="products-title"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="eyebrow" id="products-title">Products</h2><ul class="grid"><li><div class="card"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-1-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-1-w480.svg 480w, images/product-1-w960.svg 960w, images/product-1-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Speckled mug" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Speckled mug</h3><p class="blurb">Twelve ounces with a comfortable, wide handle.</p></div></div></li><li><a class="card" href="https://square.link/u/demo-bowl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-2-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-2-w480.svg 480w, images/product-2-w960.svg 960w, images/product-2-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Serving bowl" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Serving bowl</h3><p class="blurb">Wide and shallow, made for a table full of people.</p><p class="price">$48</p></div></a></li><li><div class="card"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-3-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-3-w480.svg 480w, images/product-3-w960.svg 960w, images/product-3-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Bud vase" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Bud vase</h3><p class="blurb">Holds one stem and a lot of attention.</p></div></div></li><li><div class="card"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-4-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-4-w480.svg 480w, images/product-4-w960.svg 960w, images/product-4-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Pour-over set" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Pour-over set</h3><p class="blurb">Dripper and carafe, glazed to match.</p><p class="price">$72</p></div></div></li><li><div class="card"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-5-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-5-w480.svg 480w, images/product-5-w960.svg 960w, images/product-5-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Salt cellar" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Salt cellar</h3></div></div></li><li><div class="card"><div class="card-media"><img src="images/product-6-w960.svg" srcSet="images/product-6-w480.svg 480w, images/product-6-w960.svg 960w, images/product-6-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 22vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 45vw" width="1440" height="1440" alt="Dinner plate" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="card-body"><h3>Dinner plate</h3><p class="blurb">Ten inches, stackable, quietly speckled.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><h2 class="eyebrow" id="about-title">About</h2><p>Maria started throwing pots in a community studio and never stopped. Every piece is thrown, trimmed, and glazed by hand, so no two mugs are quite the same. Most weekends you will find her at the Pearl Farmers Market with a table full of new work.</p></div><div class="portrait"><img src="images/person-1-w960.svg" srcSet="images/person-1-w480.svg 480w, images/person-1-w960.svg 960w, images/person-1-w1440.svg 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 30vw, 100vw" width="1152" height="1440" alt="Maria at the wheel" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></section><section class="section" id="visit" aria-labelledby="visit-title"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="eyebrow" id="visit-title">Where to find us</h2><ul class="markets"><li class="market"><strong>Pearl Farmers Market</strong><span>Saturdays, 9am to 1pm</span><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Pearl+Farmers+Market+San+Antonio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Maps</a></li></ul><p class="note">Look for the blue tent near the fountain.</p></div></section><section class="section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="wrap contact"><h2 class="eyebrow" id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2><a class="btn" href="tel:+12105550123">Call or text (210) 555-0123</a><div class="links"><a href="https://instagram.com/pearlstreetpottery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@pearlstreetpottery</a><span>Pearl Street Pottery</span></div></div></section></main><footer><div class="wrap"><span>Pearl Street Pottery</span> · <a href="https://nazariitsubera.com">Site by Nazarii Tsubera</a></div></footer></body></html>"
